>accourding to the 'date'
>command. This despite the year showing 1998 in the Hardware setup. It
>seems the kernel
>is messing it up when it reads from the hardware.
>
>Does anyone know if this problem is documented by DEC?

Edit the file /etc/sysconfig/clock, and make sure it says ARC=true.

This file is referenced in /etc/rc.d/rc.sysinit; also see the
documentation on /sbin/clock.



