A "14" blink code is actually a "D" error code (the blink code is a
hexadecimal number).  For a VX40 board, the service manual says
to "Replace memory modules until no failure occurs. If replacing the
SIMMS does not fix the problem, replace the system board"
 
If this is one you've just recently bought, I'd be callin' the seller
for a replacement :)

