Yes, that's the power connector.  I took an old broken power supply
and snipped off a cable that had a floppy connector and hard drive
connector on the same run.  I plugged the floppy connector on the SCSI
connector and the hard drive connector (of course) into the hard
drive.  If you plug it in looks like it should, it'll work (I don't
