>
>For some reason I cannot uncompress any of the files at this site.  I
>tried using
>gzip -d XF86_TGA-XXXXX.gz
>gunzip XF68_TGA-....
>unzip  XF86_TGA...
>tar xvfz XF86_TGA....
>gzip -dc XF86_TGA.... |tar xvf -
