>
>In each case I get a message about the file of files not being in
>proper--compressed format.  Has anyone been able to use these files or
>can someone help getting them uncompressed.


The patch should be uncompressed with gunzip and later be applied
to XFree86 source. To apply the patch you'll probably have to turn to
the directory containing the XF86_TGA code and issue the following
command: patch < [patchfile].

There are precompiled version at the same location:

http://www.cs.brown.edu/~tor/xfree86/

Good luck...

Rick






