I installed LINUX on my multia from a Windows NT FTP server by copying
the contents of the Redhat directory off the CD to my hard drive.  I
then took the "trans.tbl" file in each directory and used a word
processor to do a Search and Replace to create a batch file that would
rename the files to the correct long filename.

It's a bit of a pain, but it worked.

