I'm still struggling with my alpha install, but last night I observed 
that adding 'rw' to the boot command resolved this problem for me.

So try: 

 boot dva0 -file vmlinuz.gz -flags "rw load_ramdisk=1 prompt_ramdisk=1
 root=/dev/scd0"



