> 
>  INSTALL REDHAT 5.1 FROM LINUX/ALPHA CD:
> 
>  1. on another Unix machine, in our case running DEC Unix, prepare
>         two floppies using the dd command; one each containing the
>         avanti-s.img and ramdisk.img files from the RedHat 5.1 CD.
>         our exact command to write the floppies was:
>               dd if=avanti-s.img of=/dev/fd0 bs=1440k, and
>         similar for the ramdisk.img floppy. See appendix B of the
>         RedHat 5.1 Installation manual.
>  2. put the kernel floppy (avanti-s.img) in the AS200 and at the
>         SRM prompt issue, all on one line:
>               boot dva0 -file vmlinux.gz -flags "root=/dev/fd0
