module similar to ip-masq-cuseeme that would work for netmeeting or (d) some
other method of using Netmeeting/Intel Internet Video Phone/other H.323 apps on 
Linux/axp (like an H.323 proxy .rpm for RH/axp)?

I'd appreciate help and/or pointers since I've read all the dejanews, 
